From 5ba7fffaa7a4fa2bc654eb61ce041d803d57c764 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:07:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] More useful status updates: status event, image description,
 model loading, tool wording
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New SSE event {"status": text} shown on the status line
- Vision relay now reports "Describing image with <model>…"
- Announce "Loading <model> into memory" when Ollama hasn't loaded it yet (/api/ps)
- History is built inside the stream (views._prepare_history) so statuses can be sent
- toolStatus(): "Searching the web: <query>", "Reading <host>" etc. instead of internal tool names
- CHANGES.md: document

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYWF5DEBkW3yKS3tvDRXHL
